&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Generalist&amp;nbsp;(People Experience Consultant)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Mateo, CA (hybrid in office 2x a week)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior HR Generalist (People Experience Consultant) to join our People Experience (PX) team. This position will provide high-touch operational and strategic support to People &amp;amp; Places Business Partners and their client groups, with particular emphasis on Business and Product, Legal and Finance, AMER populations. The successful candidate will manage complex employee lifecycle activity, serve as a trusted escalation point, coordinate cross-functional programs, and translate business needs into accurate, well-controlled execution across Workday, ServiceNow, and partner teams. The role requires strong judgment, urgency, data discipline, and the ability to lead sensitive work through clear ownership, documentation, and follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Duties/Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Deliver HR services as an extension of the HRBP team and as part of the core PX service model, building strong relationships with business leaders and understanding the distinct needs of each client group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Support HRBPs with workforce planning, organizational design, talent and performance cycles, compensation planning, engagement activity, manager coaching, and other priority initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Act as a Tier 2 escalation point for employee and manager questions, owning issues through resolution and coordinating with Payroll, Benefits, Compensation, Mobility, Employee Relations &amp;amp; Legal, and other COEs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Manage complex employee lifecycle activity, including job and organization changes, international transfers, relocations, performance processes, terminations, severance and post-exit questions, and related Workday transactions and approvals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with Employee Relations and Legal on performance concerns, business cases, role eliminations, restructures, involuntary terminations, mutual separations, and other sensitive matters, applying sound judgment on cases that require escalation or handoff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Coordinate multi-region workforce change projects, including impact-data ownership, project plans, manager materials, employee communications, exit documentation, quality assurance, notification-day execution, and post-event follow-up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own and maintain accurate trackers, impact sheets, coverage maps, process documentation, and shared repositories; establish a reliable source of truth and prevent duplicate or conflicting records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Support annual and mid-year talent, performance, promotion, and compensation processes, including manager guidance, data audits, exception management, access mapping, and issue resolution for populations outside standard system workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain employee data and execute or coordinate Workday transactions with strong attention to confidentiality, approval controls, audit requirements, and timely completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Manage ServiceNow cases assigned to the PX Consultant team, monitor aging and handoffs, and provide clear, responsive updates to employees, managers, and partner teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Use data and dashboards to identify trends, strengthen controls, improve service delivery, and provide actionable insights to HRBPs and PX leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement by documenting repeatable workflows, defining roles and handoffs, creating manager and employee guidance, and using digital tools and AI to improve quality, speed, and consistency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Knowledge / Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;7+ years of progressive HR generalist, HR operations, or HRBP-support experience in a fast-paced, high-tech, creative, or entertainment environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven success partnering with senior HR and business leaders and coordinating work across HRBPs, Employee Relations, Legal, Payroll, Compensation, Benefits, Mobility, Talent, and HR Technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong business/commercial acumen, curiosity and high learning agility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing sensitive employee matters, performance concerns, workforce changes, terminations, and post-exit issues with discretion and sound judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of U.S. employment laws and federal and state regulations; experience supporting Canada, Latin America, EMEA, or other international populations is strongly valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong Workday capability, including employee data changes, organizational transactions, approvals, reporting, and audit-minded quality control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong AI skills, developing and deploying tools to assist personally and with the PXC team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with ServiceNow or another HR case-management platform, including case ownership, escalation, documentation, and stakeholder communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Advanced organizational and project-management skills, with the ability to manage multiple confidential workstreams, deadlines, trackers, and stakeholders without losing accuracy or follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Highly data literate, with experience auditing information, maintaining a source of truth, producing reports or dashboards, and translating data into decisions and process improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to create clear manager guidance, process documentation, employee communications, and executive-ready updates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a global, matrixed environment and taking initiative where ownership, process, or handoffs are not yet fully defined.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong Microsoft Word, PowerPoint, and Excel skills, with practical experience using AI and digital tools to improve HR service delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;PHR, SHRM-CP, or equivalent professional HR certification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience in the games, technology, media, or entertainment industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting engineering, product, finance, legal, or other complex client groups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating reductions in force, restructuring activity, global performance and compensation cycles, or international employee processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience developing SOPs, dashboards, AI-enabled tools, or other scalable HR solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$154,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$231,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
